==Battleground==
*4 [[Cala Maria]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*4 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*6 [[Znache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is a DPS check against Cala Maria, bring 3 cheap meatshields and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], then spam attackers. Make sure you bring a few midrangers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to handle the Zories and Znaches. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] will make quick work of the Cala Marias if properly defended.

